{"id": 63393, "date": "2025-12-20T04:00:02", "date_gmt": "2025-12-20T12:00:02", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=63393"}, "modified": "2026-08-04T21:20:51", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-05T04:20:51", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-20-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/20/kingdom-of-days-december-20-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 20"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p><strong>1968:\u00a0</strong>Earth\u00a0 plays two shows at the Off Broad Street Coffee House in Red Bank, New Jersey.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23414\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1968-12-20/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1968-12-20.png?fit=1236%2C606&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1236,606\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1968-12-20\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1968-12-20.png?fit=758%2C372&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23414 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1968-12-20.png?resize=758%2C372&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1968-12-20.png?w=1236&amp;ssl=1 1236w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1968-12-20.png?resize=300%2C147&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1968-12-20.png?resize=1024%2C502&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1968-12-20.png?resize=768%2C377&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1973:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and his unnamed band play the Bristol Motor Inn in Bristol, Rhode Island.</p>\n<p><strong>1974:\u00a0</strong>Bruce goes to New York City to visit WPLJ-FM, where he sits down for an interview with Father Bill Ayres. They talk for over an hour, but the interview won&#8217;t be aired until April, and even then only in significantly edited form.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/w-12DlTy7v0?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>1975:\u00a0</strong>Bruce continues his first ever tour of Canada with a show at the National Arts Center in Ottawa.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23415\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1975-12-20/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?fit=2079%2C1389&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2079,1389\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1975-12-20\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?fit=758%2C506&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23415 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?resize=758%2C506&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"506\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?w=2079&amp;ssl=1 2079w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?resize=1024%2C684&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?resize=1536%2C1026&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-20.png?resize=2048%2C1368&amp;ssl=1 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23418\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1975-12-20b/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-20b.png?fit=1831%2C1463&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1831,1463\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1975-12-20b\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-20b.png?fit=758%2C606&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23418 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-20b.png?resize=758%2C606&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"606\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-20b.png?w=1831&amp;ssl=1 1831w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-20b.png?resize=300%2C240&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-20b.png?resize=1024%2C818&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-20b.png?resize=768%2C614&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-20b.png?resize=1536%2C1227&amp;ssl=1 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1978:\u00a0</strong>Bruce completes his west coast Darkness swing with a show at the Seattle Center Arena, where he and the E Street Band play &#8220;Pretty Flamingo&#8221; for the first time since the Born to Run Tour. Well after the show ends, after most fans have filed out of the arena and the house lights are on, Bruce returns to the stage to perform two more songs&#8211;&#8220;Rave On&#8221; and &#8220;Twist and Shout.&#8221;</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hYFx4Yr8-D8?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TmV-b1mlUxM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23416\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1978-12-20/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1978-12-20.png?fit=504%2C1840&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"504,1840\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1978-12-20\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1978-12-20.png?fit=280%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23416 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1978-12-20.png?resize=504%2C1840&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"1840\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1978-12-20.png?w=504&amp;ssl=1 504w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1978-12-20.png?resize=82%2C300&amp;ssl=1 82w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1978-12-20.png?resize=421%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 421w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1994:\u00a0</strong>Bruce joins Tim McLoone&#8217;s Holiday Express on stage at Tradewinds in Sea Bright, New Jersey.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nbv2xybqvpQ?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>1999:\u00a0</strong>Bruce holds his annual Christmas party at McLoone&#8217;s Rum Runner in Sea Bright, where he joins Bobby Bandiera and his band on stage for a set of cover classics.</p>\n<p><strong>2005: </strong>Bruce and Patti take in\u00a0<em>Dirty Rotten Scoundrels\u00a0</em>on Broadway and are invited backstage to meet the cast.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"55378\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/daily_news_2005_12_23_129-1/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Daily_News_2005_12_23_129-1.jpg?fit=1470%2C1085&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1470,1085\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Daily_News_2005_12_23_129 (1)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Daily_News_2005_12_23_129-1.jpg?fit=758%2C560&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-55378 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Daily_News_2005_12_23_129-1.jpg?resize=758%2C559&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"559\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Daily_News_2005_12_23_129-1.jpg?w=1470&amp;ssl=1 1470w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Daily_News_2005_12_23_129-1.jpg?resize=300%2C221&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Daily_News_2005_12_23_129-1.jpg?resize=1024%2C756&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Daily_News_2005_12_23_129-1.jpg?resize=768%2C567&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>2017:\u00a0</strong><em>Springsteen on Broadway\u00a0</em>continues its theatrical run at the Walter Kerr Theater in New York City.</p>\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" id=\"audio-63393-7\" preload=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"audio/mpeg\" src=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/2017-12-20-Thunder__Merged.mp3?_=7\" /><a href=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/2017-12-20-Thunder__Merged.mp3\">https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/2017-12-20-Thunder__Merged.mp3</a></audio>\n<p><strong>2020:\u00a0</strong>Bruce phones E Street Radio DJ Jim Rotolo for a year-in-review discussion, during which Bruce surprises fans with the premiere of an E Street Band cover of Slim Dunlap&#8217;s &#8220;Girlfriend.&#8221;</p>\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" id=\"audio-63393-8\" preload=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"audio/mpeg\" src=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2024-12-20-Bruceon-E-St-Radio.mp3?_=8\" /><a href=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2024-12-20-Bruceon-E-St-Radio.mp3\">https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2024-12-20-Bruceon-E-St-Radio.mp3</a></audio>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>Listen to a 1974 interview, a legendary &#8217;78 concert, and watch a 1994 holiday show appearance&#8211;all from this date.</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 1, "featured_media": 14769, "comment_status": "open", "ping_status": "open", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking": false, "_jetpack_newsletter_access": "", "_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs": false, "_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id": 0, "_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content": false, "_jetpack_feature_clip_id": 0, "_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content": false, "footnotes": "", "jetpack_publicize_message": "", "jetpack_publicize_feature_enabled": true, "jetpack_social_post_already_shared": true, "jetpack_social_options": {"image_generator_settings": {"template": "highway", "default_image_id": 0, "font": "", "enabled": false}, "version": 2}, "jetpack_post_was_ever_published": false}, "categories": [2], "tags": [798, 1303, 424, 508, 289, 689, 1946, 1999, 138, 523, 273, 1994], "class_list": ["post-63393", "post", "type-post", "status-publish", "format-standard", "has-post-thumbnail", "hentry", "category-kingdom-of-days", "tag-bobby-bandiera", "tag-born-to-run-tour", "tag-canada", "tag-darkness-tour", "tag-earth", "tag-father-bill-ayres", "tag-holiday-shows", "tag-ontario", "tag-ottawa", "tag-seattle", "tag-springsteen-on-broadway", "tag-tim-mcloone"], "aioseo_notices": [], "aioseo_head": "\n\t\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\n\t<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"max-image-preview:large\" />\n\t<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Ken\"/>\n\t<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/20/kingdom-of-days-december-20-2/\" />\n\t<meta name=\"g